    {
      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html#getSort()\">getSort</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\">ParameterAccessor</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the sort instance to be used for query creation. Will use a <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> parameter if available or the\n        <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> contained in a <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> if available. <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a> if no <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> can\n        be found.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html#getSort()\">getSort</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\">ParameterAccessor</a></code> 中的方法</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>用于查询创建的排序实例。如果存在，将使用 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 参数；或者如果存在，将使用 <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 中包含的 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>。如果找不到任何 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>，则返回 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html#getLimit()\">getLimit</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\">ParameterAccessor</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> instance to be used for query creation. If no <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a>\n        assignable to <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> can be found <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> will be created out of\n        <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> if present.</dd>",
