    {
      "source": "the sort instance to be used for query creation. Will use a <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> parameter if available or the\n        <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> contained in a <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> if available. <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a> if no <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> can\n        be found.",
      "translation": "用于创建查询的排序实例。如果可用，将使用 `<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>` 参数；否则，如果可用，则使用 `<a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>` 中包含的 `<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>`。若找不到任何 `<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>`，则使用 `<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> instance to be used for query creation. If no <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a>\n        assignable to <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> can be found <a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a> will be created out of\n        <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a> if present.",
      "translation": "用于查询创建的 `<a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a>` 实例。如果找不到可赋值给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a> 的 `<a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a>`，则将从 <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\"><code>Pageable.getPageSize()</code></a>（如果存在）创建 `<a href=\"../../domain/Limit.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Limit</code></a>`。",
